# Main Architecture

Use **Feature-first Modular Hexagonal Architecture** adapted for Cloudflare Workers AI and `@cloudflare/think`.

The preferred flow is:

```txt
Worker Handler → Use Case → Port Interface → Adapter → External Service / Storage / Cloudflare Binding
```

For Think agent tool calls, use:

```txt
Think Tool → Use Case → Port Interface → Adapter → External Service / Storage / Cloudflare Binding
```

Do not use classic Node.js MVC as the default.

Avoid large generic folders grouped only by technical layer:

```txt
controllers/
services/
repositories/
```

Prefer feature-first modules with ports and adapters.

