# Handler Rules

Handlers should:

* parse request
* validate auth/signature
* validate body
* normalize external input
* create use case dependencies
* call use case
* map result to HTTP response

Handlers should not:

* contain AI prompt orchestration
* contain business logic
* directly query storage
* directly call Workers AI
* directly call Slack API
* directly perform complex tool execution

