# Environment and Bindings

All environment access must go through typed `Env`.

Define environment types in:

```txt
src/shared/env.ts
```

Example:

```ts
export interface Env {
  THINK_AGENT: DurableObjectNamespace;
  AI?: Ai;
  DB?: D1Database;
  KV?: KVNamespace;
  R2?: R2Bucket;
  VECTORIZE?: VectorizeIndex;
  QUEUE?: Queue;
  SLACK_BOT_TOKEN: string;
  INTERNAL_API_TOKEN: string;
}
```

Do not pass raw `env` deeply into use cases.

Create adapters at the boundary and inject ports.

Validate required environment values during bootstrap where possible.

